      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.04 (vs ₹1.31 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.04 (down from ₹1.31 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.02b (down 1.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.61m (down 97% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.3% (down from 8.1% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 95 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
